:6 ; 21:2 ; ביהוה 35:9 ; Isa 41:16 ; Zech 10:7 ; באלהים Isa 61:10 ; Hab 3:18 ; י ׳בשׁם Psa 89:17 ; ישׂראל בקדושׁ Isa 29:19 ; ב ושׂמח ׳גיל Psa 31:8 ; 118:24 ; Song 1:4 ; Isa 25:9 ; Joel 2:23 ; כ ושׂמחי ׳גילי 2:21 . c. with עַל Zeph 3:17 . Besides persons the subject is לֵב Psa 13:6 ; Prov 24:17 ; Zech 10:7 ; נפשׁ Psa 35:9 ; Isa 61:10 , כבוד ( = נפשׁ ) Psa 16:9 , ארץ 1Chr 16:31 ; Psa 96:11 ; 97:1 ; Isa 49:13 , ערבה 35:1-2 ,. 2 tremble (compare Arabic ) Psa 2:11 || עבד (Thes Ew Hi Che, but ᵐ5 Hu De Pe AV RV rejoice ), Hosea 10:5 || אבל (Thes and most modern, but AV RV that rejoiced over it), possibly error for חיל Ew Gr Che.","rootNote":"or (by permutation) גּוּל ; a primitive root;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Chr 16 31","keyReferences":["1Chr 16 31","Hab 1 15","Hab 3 18","Hos 10 5","Isa 9 2","Isa 25 9","Isa 29 19","Isa 35 1"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":46,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Chr 16 31","book":"1Chr","chapter":16,"verse":31,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וְ/תָגֵ֣ל","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Vqj3fs"},{"reference":"Hab 1 15","book":"Hab","chapter":1,"verse":15,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וְ/יָגִֽיל","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Vqi3ms"},{"reference":"Hab 3 18","book":"Hab","chapter":3,"verse":18,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"אָגִ֖ילָה","source":"hebrew","morph":"HVqh1cs"},{"reference":"Hos 10 5","book":"Hos","chapter":10,"verse":5,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"יָגִ֔ילוּ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HVqi3mp"},{"reference":"Isa 9 2","book":"Isa","chapter":9,"verse":2,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"יָגִ֖ילוּ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HVqi3mp"},{"reference":"Isa 25 9","book":"Isa","chapter":25,"verse":9,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"נָגִ֥ילָה","source":"hebrew","morph":"HVqh1cp"},{"reference":"Isa 29 19","book":"Isa","chapter":29,"verse":19,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"יָגִֽילוּ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HVqi3mp"},{"reference":"Isa